      "t": "Стульчик, да?",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around Can I help line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Шеф, может помочь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, can I help?' Ainura offers her assistance, turning a simple phrase into a question just by raising her pitch at the end.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Не знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don' Feeling completely defeated, the head cook admits he has no idea what to do next.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Меня он оштрафовал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He fined me.' Barinov gives a blunt update, stating that the restaurant has been hit with a financial penalty.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Тебя депортировать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You must be deported.' The harsh reality comes out as he tells her she is going to be sent away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Думаю, что это?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm thinking, what is this?' Pausing to collect his thoughts, the boss tries to figure out their current predicament.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Думаю, нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't think so.' Quickly dismissing an idea, he rejects the possibility out of hand.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "С другим может...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maybe with another...' A flicker of hope appears as he wonders if dealing with a different official might change things.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Договориться удастся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We could negotiate.' The possibility of reaching a mutual agreement or paying a bribe is briefly entertained.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Вот.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There.' Handing something over, the cleaner uses a tiny word to focus attention on the object.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Хотя...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Though...' A sudden afterthought makes her pause, hinting that she has an alternative plan.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Если ты ему жизнь спасёшь...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you save his life...' Suggesting a wild hypothetical scenario, she brings up the idea of a dramatic rescue.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Может, он нас и простит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maybe he will forgive us.' The optimistic conclusion is that such an extreme favor might cancel out their rule-breaking.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Стульчик, да?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A chair, right?' Picking up a heavy object, she checks if this makeshift weapon is what he needs. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
